# Authorized Ed25519 client keys
# Generate a compact client key and one entry with:
# tunnel-rs generate-auth-key --output client.key --comment "alice laptop"
#
# Format: tunnelrsv1authpub:<unpadded url-safe base64 32-byte public key>[ comment]
# One space separates the key from the comment, which runs to end of line.
# tunnelrsv1authpub:1bhGIken5UAXTkC7cABRzM4cE98xZl3tilGyYZsoyP8 alice laptop
